        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86421, Retro Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Art Deco Cabinet Knob has that charm that brings to mind the style and ease of a simpler time. 1950's Diners and Soda Fountains would have been the most fashionable if they would have had the Emtek Art Deco Knob. This retro cabinet hardware is available in all the finish colors you might expect including the classic polished chrome and a more modern satin brass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86421-specifications.gif?v=1704354775\" width=\"600\" height=\"258\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86421 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Retro Art Deco Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
